{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PqsknpXiQ1YtjfpUgQaXer","type":"tool_result","content":"**Yes, there's a free plan, but no free trial as such.** It's an ongoing tier.\n\n- **Credits:** 1,000 credits per month, refreshed monthly. That's roughly 500 searches or 1,000 scraped pages.\n- **Credit card:** Not required. The page says \"No cost, no card, no hassle.\"\n- **Limits:**\n  - 2 concurrent requests (browsers).\n  - Low rate limits, such as 10 requests/min on /scrape, /map, and /search, and 2/min on /crawl and /interact.\n  - Community-level support only.\n  - No credit rollover.\n  - Pay-as-you-go isn't available, since it requires a paid plan.\n- **Other caveats:** Search and scrape share one credit balance. Features like JSON format cost extra credits. Pages returning errors such as 403 or 404 still cost 1 credit. Agent includes 5 free daily runs while in preview."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a6f8a7a-c2b5-4b3c-b900-60d84acaf38d","uuid":"28bf01b6-a173-4cfb-bbbb-abbfe72cdf1a","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:36:00.206Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":799539,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Yes, there's a free plan, but no free trial as such.** It's an ongoing tier.\n\n- **Credits:** 1,000 credits per month, refreshed monthly. That's roughly 500 searches or 1,000 scraped pages.\n- **Credit card:** Not required. The page says \"No cost, no card, no hassle.\"\n- **Limits:**\n  - 2 concurrent requests (browsers).\n  - Low rate limits, such as 10 requests/min on /scrape, /map, and /search, and 2/min on /crawl and /interact.\n  - Community-level support only.\n  - No credit rollover.\n  - Pay-as-you-go isn't available, since it requires a paid plan.\n- **Other caveats:** Search and scrape share one credit balance. Features like JSON format cost extra credits. Pages returning errors such as 403 or 404 still cost 1 credit. Agent includes 5 free daily runs while in preview.","durationMs":5007,"url":"https://www.firecrawl.dev/pricing"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PqsknpXiQ1YtjfpUgQaXer","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg72imdVGHGkLdw8wU5q7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, you can try Firecrawl for free, and you don't need a card. Their pricing page lists a free plan with the line \"No cost, no card, no hassle.\"\n\n- **Credits:** You get 1,000 per month, and they refresh monthly with no rollover. That's about 1,000 scraped pages or about 500 searches.\n- **Limits:**\n  - 2 concurrent requests.\n  - Low rate limits, such as 10 requests/min on scrape, map and search, and 2/min on crawl and interact.\n  - Community-level support only.\n- **Credit costs:**\n  - Search and scrape draw from the same balance.\n  - Some features, such as JSON format, cost extra credits.\n  - Pages that return errors like 403 or 404 still cost 1 credit.\n- **Paid plans:** Pay-as-you-go needs a paid plan.\n\nI got this from the pricing page just now, but plans change, so check [firecrawl.dev/pricing](https://www.firecrawl.dev/pricing) before you sign up."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":467,"cache_read_input_tokens":18566,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":467},"output_tokens":338,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a6f8a7a-c2b5-4b3c-b900-60d84acaf38d","uuid":"987487ab-3953-4c19-9759-148b1b704c1b","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:36:02.979Z","request_id":"req_011Cg72imPqy8iq4ZwEY521Z"}
